const topics=[...new Set(['整站导航','信息层级','阅读布局','学习反馈','动效引导',...ATLAS_CASES.flatMap(c=>c.tags)])];
const count=n=>String(n).padStart(2,'0');
function demoCount(){const paths=new Set();for(const c of ATLAS_CASES)for(const section of c.sections){const template=document.createElement('template');template.innerHTML=section.html;for(const frame of template.content.querySelectorAll('iframe[src]'))paths.add(frame.getAttribute('src'));}return paths.size;}
const main=document.querySelector('main');
let currentTopic='全部',query='';
function esc(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));}
function nav(){const route=location.hash.slice(1).split('/')[0];document.querySelector('.nav-item span').textContent=count(ATLAS_CASES.length);for(const link of document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item')){const active=link.hash==='#method'?route==='method':route!=='method';link.classList.toggle('active',active);if(active)link.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else link.removeAttribute('aria-current');}const c=ATLAS_CASES.find(c=>c.id===main.dataset.case);document.querySelector('.breadcrumb').textContent='研习空间 / '+(route==='method'?'收录方法':route==='case'?(c?.name||'案例尚未收录'):currentTopic==='全部'?'案例索引':currentTopic);document.querySelector('#topics').innerHTML=topics.map(t=>`<a class="topic ${route==='topic'&&t===currentTopic?'selected':''}" href="#topic/${encodeURIComponent(t)}">${t}</a>`).join('');}
function miniature(){return `<div class="blueprint" aria-label="文档布局示意图，非原站截图"><div class="mini-browser"><div class="mini-top">○ ○ ○ <span style="float:right">DOCUMENTATION / STRUCTURE</span></div><div class="mini-grid"><div class="mini-left"><div class="mini-tag">Introduction</div>${'<div class="mini-line"></div>'.repeat(5)}</div><div><div class="mini-title">A place for clarity.</div><div class="mini-line"></div><div class="mini-line"></div><div class="mini-line" style="width:70%"></div><div style="background:#f4f6f1;padding:9px;margin-top:18px"><div class="mini-line"></div><div class="mini-line"></div></div></div><div class="mini-aside"><div class="mini-line"></div><div class="mini-line"></div><div class="mini-line"></div></div></div></div></div>`;}
function results(){const filtered=ATLAS_CASES.filter(c=>(currentTopic==='全部'||c.tags.includes(currentTopic))&&`${c.name}${c.title}${c.tags.join('')}`.toLowerCase().includes(query.toLowerCase()));document.querySelector('#results').innerHTML=filtered.length?filtered.map(c=>`<article class="card">${miniature()}<div class="card-body"><div class="chips">${c.tags.map(t=>`<span class="chip">${t}</span>`).join('')}</div><h3>${esc(c.name)}</h3><h4>${esc(c.title)}</h4><p>${esc(c.summary)}</p><div class="card-bottom"><span>${c.date} · 原创局部演示</span><a class="button" href="#case/${c.id}">进入研习 →</a></div></div></article>`).join(''):`<div class="empty">暂无匹配案例。宁可留白，也不重复收录。<br><button class="button secondary" id="reset">查看全部案例</button></div>`;document.querySelector('#reset')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{query='';location.hash='';render();});}
function index(){main.innerHTML=`<section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">OBSERVE / UNDERSTAND / REBUILD</div><h1>从看见好设计，<br>到理解它如何发生。</h1><p>一份持续生长的界面研习档案。以设计问题为线索，<br>连接整站结构、视觉判断与可以亲手运行的前端实现。</p></section><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong>${String(ATLAS_CASES.length).padStart(2,'0')}</strong><span>深入案例</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>${count(new Set(ATLAS_CASES.flatMap(c=>c.tags)).size)}</strong><span>已覆盖问题</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>${count(demoCount())}</strong><span>交互实验</span></div></div><div class="bar"><h2>${currentTopic==='全部'?'案例索引':esc(currentTopic)} <span style="color:#9ba698;font-size:12px">/ CASE STUDIES</span></h2><input class="search" aria-label="搜索案例" placeholder="搜索案例、设计问题…" value="${esc(query)}"></div><div id="results"></div><div class="note">本期关注：复杂内容怎样组织。每个案例从整站全貌出发，深入一个有证据、可验证的问题。</div>`;document.querySelector('.search').addEventListener('input',e=>{query=e.target.value;results();});results();}
function detail(id){const c=ATLAS_CASES.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!c){main.innerHTML='<h1>案例尚未收录</h1><a href="#">返回索引</a>';return;}main.innerHTML=`<a class="back" href="#">← 返回案例索引</a><div class="detail-head"><p class="eyebrow">CASE ${String(ATLAS_CASES.indexOf(c)+1).padStart(3,'0')} / ${c.date}</p><h1>${esc(c.name)}<br>${esc(c.title)}</h1><p>${esc(c.summary)}</p></div><div class="source-links">${c.sources.map(([n,u])=>`<a href="${u}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(n)} ↗</a>`).join('')}</div><h2 style="font-size:16px">整站研习地图 <span style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">选择你感兴趣的入口</span></h2><div class="map">${c.sections.map((s,i)=>`<a href="#case/${c.id}/${s.id}"><span class="eyebrow">0${i+1}</span> ${s.title}<small>${s.subtitle}</small></a>`).join('')}</div>${c.sections.map(s=>`<section class="section" id="${s.id}"><h2>${s.title}</h2>${s.html}</section>`).join('')}`;for(const [id,small] of [['desktop-demo',false],['tablet-demo',true]])document.getElementById(id)?.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.getElementById('demo-wrap').classList.toggle('tablet',small);document.getElementById('desktop-demo').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(!small));document.getElementById('tablet-demo').setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(small));});}
function method(){main.innerHTML=`<div class="eyebrow">EDITORIAL STANDARD</div><h1>少而深入，有据可查。</h1><p>每次收录都应该增加一种新的理解，而不只是增加一个网址。</p><section class="section"><h2>四道收录检查</h2><ol><li><b>选题差异：</b>与已收录案例比较，必须有新的设计做法或明确取舍。</li><li><b>来源可查：</b>优先原网站、开源仓库和官方技术说明。无法核实的结论标为推测。</li><li><b>演示可运行：</b>测试交互、键盘操作、窄屏阅读与控制台错误。明确原创复现和原项目的差异。</li><li><b>初学者能读：</b>解释陌生语法、依赖与实现路径，不堆砌术语。</li></ol></section><section class="section"><h2>积累状态</h2><ul class="status-list"><li>已收录 ${ATLAS_CASES.length} 个案例；每次围绕一个设计问题深入学习。</li><li>每周候选准备：尚未启用定时任务；选题由你确认后启动，成果验收后合并发布。</li><li>计划节奏：每周日北京时间10:00准备3个候选；有待验收成果时优先处理，不追加选题。</li></ul><p>不为消耗额度制造内容，不因更新频率降低证据标准。</p></section>`;}
function render(){if(location.hash==='#main'){main.focus();return;}const parts=location.hash.slice(1).split('/');if(parts[0]==='case'){if(main.dataset.case!==parts[1])detail(parts[1]);main.dataset.case=parts[1];if(parts[2])document.getElementById(parts[2])?.scrollIntoView();else window.scrollTo(0,0);}else{delete main.dataset.case;if(parts[0]==='method')method();else{currentTopic=parts[0]==='topic'?decodeURIComponent(parts[1]):'全部';index();}window.scrollTo(0,0);}nav();}
window.addEventListener('hashchange',render);render();
